     const stats = internals.emptyCacheStats('2026-09-08');
     const before = { ...stats };

codex
The scoped edit is in place: `reportsCacheUsage: false` overrides synthesized/present cache fields to unmeasured, while unset/true still defer to response presence; the production `message_end` path passes the effective model capability into both stats and trend accounting. I’m reviewing the exact diff before running tests.
