(node:33952) [DEP0205] DeprecationWarning: `module.register()` is deprecated. Use `module.registerHooks()` instead.
(Use `node --trace-deprecation ...` to show where the warning was created)
▶ model input pricing lookup
  ✔ resolves per-token rates from the cost block (0.498667ms)
  ✔ treats missing or invalid rates as unpriced, never as free (0.080792ms)
  ✔ prices an explicit zero cached-read rate and reports real savings (0.366083ms)
  ✔ resolves pricing from the registry when the model carries no cost block (0.078583ms)
✔ model input pricing lookup (1.466042ms)
▶ cache economics cost arithmetic
  ✔ bills uncached, cached-read and write tokens at their own rates (0.095917ms)
  ✔ baseline bills every input token fully uncached (0.03425ms)
  ✔ addUsageToCacheStats accumulates cost only when priced (0.04725ms)
  ✔ records an input-only request without including it in the hit ratio (0.107875ms)
  ✔ treats a model that never reports cache usage as unmeasured while retaining economics (0.060291ms)
  ✔ counts explicit zero cache fields as one measured miss (0.145ms)
  ✔ lets a reporting model use response presence instead of forcing a hit (0.10875ms)
  ✔ ignores undefined usage without changing stats (0.341042ms)
  ✔ an unpriced request leaves cost fields at zero (0.048334ms)
✔ cache economics cost arithmetic (1.186667ms)
▶ no-cache-fields signal accounting
  ✔ a Pi-normalized response without cache fields preserves an unmeasured signal (0.068375ms)
  ✔ an OpenAI-shape raw response without cache fields preserves an unmeasured signal (0.07125ms)
  ✔ an explicit zero cache signal remains measured (0.024708ms)
  ✔ still returns undefined when there is no input count at all (0.0295ms)
✔ no-cache-fields signal accounting (0.252667ms)
▶ prefix churn detection
  ✔ counts a change between consecutive turns, not a stable prefix (0.032709ms)
  ✔ detects churn across two real turns and stays quiet on a stable prefix (22.148375ms)
✔ prefix churn detection (22.313125ms)
▶ pre-phase stats record migration
  ✔ a v6 record without economics fields loads with counters intact (0.338417ms)
  ✔ a round-trip preserves migrated counters and new fields (6.684375ms)
✔ pre-phase stats record migration (7.14425ms)
▶ cache economics stats report
  ✔ renders hit rate, cost, savings and churn for a priced non-DeepSeek model (0.167167ms)
  ✔ shows unmeasured requests and excludes them from the hit ratio (0.060667ms)
  ✔ renders "unpriced" instead of zero when the model has no pricing data (0.050958ms)
✔ cache economics stats report (0.326041ms)
