▶ model input pricing lookup
  ✔ resolves per-token rates from the cost block (0.266208ms)
  ✔ treats missing or invalid rates as unpriced, never as free (0.052166ms)
  ✔ prices an explicit zero cached-read rate and reports real savings (0.386834ms)
  ✔ resolves pricing from the registry when the model carries no cost block (0.097583ms)
✔ model input pricing lookup (1.208584ms)
▶ cache economics cost arithmetic
  ✔ bills uncached, cached-read and write tokens at their own rates (0.190833ms)
  ✔ baseline bills every input token fully uncached (0.0385ms)
  ✔ addUsageToCacheStats accumulates cost only when priced (0.051417ms)
  ✔ records an input-only request without including it in the hit ratio (0.108917ms)
  ✔ treats a model that never reports cache usage as unmeasured while retaining economics (0.057375ms)
  ✔ counts explicit zero cache fields as one measured miss (0.086042ms)
  ✔ lets a reporting model use response presence instead of forcing a hit (0.053375ms)
