  ✔ an unpriced request leaves cost fields at zero (0.033875ms)
✔ cache economics cost arithmetic (1.081375ms)
▶ no-cache-fields signal accounting
  ✔ a Pi-normalized response without cache fields preserves an unmeasured signal (0.055291ms)
  ✔ an OpenAI-shape raw response without cache fields preserves an unmeasured signal (0.069167ms)
  ✔ an explicit zero cache signal remains measured (0.02525ms)
  ✔ still returns undefined when there is no input count at all (0.027417ms)
✔ no-cache-fields signal accounting (0.235666ms)
